<title>UK: Montreal sets 150 million mark ten-year bond. [CORRECTED 15:29 GMT]</title>
<headline>Montreal sets 150 million mark ten-year bond. [CORRECTED 15:29 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank and Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank</p>
<p>(corrects from Dresdner Bank-Kleinwort Benson).</p>
<p> BORROWER   MONTREAL URBAN COMMUNITY</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    15.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.16    PAY DATE    15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50 PCT  MOODY	A2	  LISTING    FRFT</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
